 '''<p>An incident channel contains six short messages: “the partner replaced the same file,” “order 42 has two source rows,” “the transform failed after loading,” “one reconciliation query is slow,” “twenty readers are queued,” and “a partner can still see the bad view.”</p><p>The exam skill is not remembering six product names. It is mapping a <strong>symptom</strong> to the smallest control that changes the mechanism, then checking evidence. This session retrieves Days24–29; it does not infer personal mastery.</p>''',
