 {'when':'Use this retrieval session after several related platform lessons, or before a sandbox lab, when feature names are starting to blur together.','example':'A logistics pipeline has a corrected object, duplicate business keys, a failed branch, mixed warehouse pressure, and a live partner share.','decision':'Choose from the symptom before opening documentation. If you cannot name the confirming evidence, mark a curriculum gap for practice. Do not convert a browser score into certification readiness.'},
